  <%- include('../partials/public-hero') %>
  <section class="section"><div class="container split split-feature"><div class="living-collage reveal"><img class="living-large" src="/media/gallery/g10.jpeg" alt="Private bedroom at Gracious Senior Living"><img class="living-small" src="/media/gallery/g11.jpeg" alt="Smiling woman resident at Gracious Senior Living"><span class="living-caption"><i class="fa-solid fa-sun"></i> Spaces for rest, conversation and connection</span></div><div class="section-copy reveal"><span class="eyebrow dark">Family-style living</span><h2>Familiar comforts make room for confidence.</h2><p class="lead">Home is more than a bedroom. It is the freedom to settle into a favorite chair, enjoy a meal with familiar faces, spend time outdoors and move through the day without feeling rushed.</p><p>Our newly remodeled residence combines private personal space with welcoming common areas. Residents can enjoy companionship when they want it and restful privacy when they need it.</p><ul class="check-list"><li><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Tastefully arranged private bedrooms</li><li><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Inviting kitchen and shared living areas</li><li><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Screened porch, fenced backyard and resident garden</li><li><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Secure environment with 24-hour in-home staff</li></ul></div></div></section>
  <section class="spaces-showcase"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading light centered reveal"><span class="eyebrow">Take a look inside</span><h2>Spaces designed to feel easy and familiar.</h2></div><div class="space-grid">
    <article class="space-card space-wide reveal"><img src="/media/gallery/g7.jpeg" alt="Women residents gathered in a shared living area"><div><span>Community Living</span><p>Welcoming shared spaces for friendship and conversation.</p></div></article>
    <article class="space-card reveal"><img src="/media/gallery/g8.jpeg" alt="Women residents enjoying a card activity"><div><span>Meaningful Activities</span><p>Familiar games and shared moments that brighten the day.</p></div></article>
    <article class="space-card reveal"><img src="/media/gallery/g10.jpeg" alt="Private bedroom"><div><span>Private Rooms</span><p>Personal retreats for rest and dignity.</p></div></article>
  </div><div class="center-action reveal"><a class="btn btn-gold" href="/gallery">View the Full Gallery <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a></div></div></section>
  <section class="section daily-rhythm"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading centered reveal"><span class="eyebrow dark">A day at Gracious</span><h2>Structure when it helps. Flexibility where it matters.</h2><p>Each day is responsive to resident preferences and care needs, with comforting touchpoints throughout.</p></div><div class="rhythm-track">
    <article class="reveal"><time>Morning</time><span><i class="fa-solid fa-mug-hot"></i></span><h3>A Gentle Start</h3><p>Personal care, breakfast, medication support and an unhurried beginning.</p></article>
    <article class="reveal"><time>Midday</time><span><i class="fa-solid fa-palette"></i></span><h3>Purpose &amp; Activity</h3><p>Indoor or outdoor activities, appointments, conversation and nutritious lunch.</p></article>
    <article class="reveal"><time>Afternoon</time><span><i class="fa-solid fa-seedling"></i></span><h3>Connection &amp; Rest</h3><p>Garden time, games, hobbies, family visits or a peaceful personal break.</p></article>
    <article class="reveal"><time>Evening</time><span><i class="fa-solid fa-moon"></i></span><h3>Comfort &amp; Calm</h3><p>Dinner, familiar routines and attentive support as the day winds down.</p></article>
  </div></div></section>
